#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:211
msgid "Warmup Phase"
msgstr "热身阶段"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:213
msgid ""
"Most workloads run a warmup phase before the measured run. What it sends "
"is workload-specific -- ``long-doc-qa`` prefills each document, ``rag-qa-"
"quality`` prefills each document behind the system block, ``prefix-"
"suffix-tuner`` sends a full pass over its prefix pool, ``multi-round-"
"chat`` primes each session, and ``long-doc-permutator`` sends a single "
"dummy request. ``random-prefill`` has no warmup at all. Warmup requests "
"are sent with ``max_tokens=1`` and their stats are discarded, so they "
"never appear in the reported numbers."
msgstr "大多数工作负载在测量运行之前会运行一个热身阶段。它发送的内容是特定于工作负载的——``long-doc-qa`` 为每个文档预填充，``rag-qa-quality`` 在系统块后为每个文档预填充，``prefix-suffix-tuner`` 对其前缀池进行完整遍历，``multi-round-chat`` 为每个会话进行初始化，而 ``long-doc-permutator`` 发送一个单一的虚拟请求。``random-prefill`` 则完全没有热身。热身请求使用 ``max_tokens=1`` 发送，其统计数据会被丢弃，因此它们不会出现在报告的数字中。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:221
msgid ""
"Warmup serves two purposes: it absorbs the engine's one-time first-"
"request cost (``torch.compile``, CUDA-graph capture, weight paging), and "
"-- for the workloads that prefill their data -- it puts the KV cache in "
"the state the measured run is designed to exercise."
msgstr "预热有两个目的：它吸收引擎的一次性首次请求成本（``torch.compile``、CUDA 图捕获、权重分页），并且——对于那些预填充其数据的工作负载——它将 KV Cache 放置在测量运行旨在测试的状态。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:226
msgid "``--no-warmup`` skips the phase entirely and starts measuring immediately:"
msgstr "``--no-warmup`` 完全跳过该阶段并立即开始测量："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:236
msgid ""
"Use it to measure a cold start -- what the first requests against a fresh"
" engine and an empty cache actually cost -- or to shorten a smoke test "
"where the absolute numbers do not matter."
msgstr "使用它来测量冷启动——即对一个新引擎和空缓存的第一次请求实际消耗的成本——或者缩短一个绝对数字无关紧要的冒烟测试。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:242
msgid ""
"Do not compare a ``--no-warmup`` run against a warmed run: the numbers "
"measure different things. Without warmup, the first requests pay the "
"engine's first-request cost and read from a cold cache, which inflates "
"TTFT and depresses cache hit rate."
msgstr "不要将 ``--no-warmup`` 运行与预热运行进行比较：这些数字测量的是不同的内容。没有预热时，第一次请求支付引擎的首次请求成本并从冷缓存中读取，这会导致 TTFT 增加并降低缓存命中率。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:247
msgid ""
"For workloads whose warmup populates the data they then measure reuse of "
"(``long-doc-qa``, ``rag-qa-quality``, ``prefix-suffix-tuner``, ``multi-"
"round-chat``), skipping it removes the reuse the workload was built to "
"measure. ``prefix-suffix-tuner`` in particular reports pass-2 results "
"against a cache that pass 1 was supposed to fill, so its output is not "
"meaningful with ``--no-warmup``."
msgstr "对于那些通过预热填充数据以便随后测量重用的工作负载（``long-doc-qa``、``rag-qa-quality``、``prefix-suffix-tuner``、``multi-round-chat``），跳过预热会移除工作负载构建时所测量的重用。特别是，``prefix-suffix-tuner`` 在第二次传递中报告的结果是基于第一次传递应该填充的缓存，因此在使用 ``--no-warmup`` 时，其输出没有意义。"

