#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:432
msgid "Each request has the layout::"
msgstr "每个请求的布局::"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:436
msgid ""
"``num_prefixes`` distinct prefixes, each starting with ``PREFIX_<8-hex>``"
" so the prefix's tokenized hash differs across the pool."
msgstr ""
"``num_prefixes`` 个不同的前缀，每个前缀以 ``PREFIX_<8-hex>`` 开头，以确保各前缀在池内的 token "
"化哈希各不相同。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:438
msgid ""
"A fresh random 32-token breaker per request, defeating ordinary prefix "
"caching past the prefix boundary."
msgstr "每个请求包含一段新的随机 32-token 分隔符，用于突破普通前缀缓存的前缀边界。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:440
msgid ""
"A single shared suffix used by every request -- the only entry CacheBlend"
" can reuse."
msgstr "所有请求共享的单个后缀 —— 这是 CacheBlend 唯一能够重用的条目。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:443
msgid ""
"Pass 1 (warmup) sends each prefix once to populate the cache; its stats "
"are discarded. Pass 2 sends them again in identical order. Because LRU "
"evicts the next-needed prefix on each pass-2 access, even a 1.05x "
"overflow of the targeted tier is enough to make every pass-2 request miss"
" that tier and fall through to the next one."
msgstr ""
"第 1 遍（预热）将每个前缀各发送一次以填充缓存，其统计数据被丢弃。第 2 遍以相同顺序再次发送。由于 LRU 在每次第 2 "
"遍访问时会逐出下一个所需前缀，即使目标层仅溢出 1.05 倍，也足以使每个第 2 遍请求在该层未命中并降级到下一层。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:456
msgid "``--psf-context-length``"
msgstr "``--psf-context-length``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:457
msgid "8000"
msgstr "8000"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:458
msgid "Total tokens per request (prefix + breaker + suffix)."
msgstr "每个请求的总 token 数（前缀 + 分隔符 + 后缀）。"

