#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:713
msgid ""
"Config files store benchmark parameters but **not** environment-specific "
"values like engine URL or LMCache URL. This lets you reuse the same "
"config across different environments."
msgstr ""
"配置文件存储基准测试参数，但\\ **不**\\ 存储特定于环境的值（如引擎 URL 或 LMCache "
"URL），以便同一份配置可在不同环境下复用。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:717
msgid "You can create a config file in three ways:"
msgstr "您可以通过三种方式创建配置文件："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:719
msgid ""
"**Interactive mode** -- choose \"Export configuration\" at the summary "
"step."
msgstr "**交互模式** -- 在摘要步骤选择“导出配置”。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:720
msgid "**``--export-config``** -- resolve and export from CLI without running."
msgstr "**``--export-config``** -- 从 CLI 解析并导出，而不运行。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:721
msgid ""
"**Manually** -- write JSON with keys matching CLI arg names (dashes "
"replaced by underscores)."
msgstr "**手动编写** —— 编写 JSON，键名与 CLI 参数名称对应（将连字符替换为下划线）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:724
msgid "Example config file:"
msgstr "示例配置文件："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:739
msgid "Load it with ``--config`` (engine URL must be provided separately):"
msgstr "通过 ``--config`` 加载该配置文件（引擎 URL 需单独提供）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:746
msgid ""
"CLI arguments override config file values, so you can use a base config "
"and tweak individual settings:"
msgstr "命令行参数会覆盖配置文件中的值，因此可以以基础配置为模板，按需调整个别设置："

