#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:862
msgid ""
"An unparsed sample's ``f1`` is ``null``, **not** ``0.0`` -- so a cross-"
"run diff can pair by ``sample_id`` and skip what either run failed to "
"score, rather than averaging a parsing failure in as a wrong answer."
msgstr "未解析样本的 ``f1`` 为 ``null``，**而不是** ``0.0`` -- 因此跨运行差异可以通过 ``sample_id`` 配对，并跳过任何运行未能评分的内容，而不是将解析失败平均为错误答案。"

