msgstr "在运行期间抑制所有进度消息。仅输出最终的结构化指标摘要（除非也通过 ``--output`` 重定向）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1019
msgid "CPU mode (no GPU)"
msgstr "CPU 模式（无 GPU）"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1021
msgid ""
"``--mode cpu`` runs the same end-to-end path without a GPU. The server "
"runs on a CPU-only host (``StubCPUDevice``); the bench tool allocates "
"POSIX-SHM-backed KV tensors and exercises the full RPC path."
msgstr ""
"``--mode cpu`` 在没有 GPU 的情况下运行相同的端到端路径。服务器在仅有 CPU 的主机 (``StubCPUDevice``) "
"上运行；基准工具分配基于 POSIX-SHM 的 KV 张量并执行完整的 RPC 路径。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1025
msgid ""
"By default ``--mode cpu`` uses the engine-driven gather/scatter path "
"(``auto`` → ``cpu→engine_driven``); that path requires the server to be "
"started with ``--supported-transfer-mode engine_driven`` or ``auto``, "
"since the server's default ``lmcache_driven`` does not load it. To use "
"the zero-copy SHM handle path instead, pass ``--transfer-mode "
"lmcache_driven``:"
msgstr "默认情况下，``--mode cpu`` 使用引擎驱动的收集/分发路径 (``auto`` → ``cpu→engine_driven``)；该路径要求服务器以 ``--supported-transfer-mode engine_driven`` 或 ``auto`` 启动，因为服务器的默认 ``lmcache_driven`` 不会加载它。要改用零拷贝 SHM 句柄路径，请传递 ``--transfer-mode lmcache_driven``："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1048
msgid "KV cache shape spec"
msgstr "KV 缓存形状规格"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1050
msgid ""
"The ``--kvcache-shape-spec`` flag describes how KV tensors are laid out "
"on the GPU. A spec is one or more groups separated by ``;``:"
msgstr "``--kvcache-shape-spec`` 参数描述 KV 张量在 GPU 上的布局，规格由一个或多个以 ``;`` 分隔的组构成："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1057
msgid "Fields:"
msgstr "字段："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1059
msgid "``kv_size`` -- 2 for classical attention (separate K/V), 1 for MLA."
msgstr "``kv_size`` —— 经典注意力机制（独立 K/V）为 2，MLA 为 1。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1060
msgid "``NB`` -- number of paged blocks."
msgstr "``NB`` —— 分页块数量。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1061
msgid "``BS`` -- block size (tokens per block)."
msgstr "``BS`` —— 块大小（每块的 token 数）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1062
msgid "``NH`` -- number of attention heads per layer."
msgstr "``NH`` —— 每层的注意力头数量。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1063
msgid "``HS`` -- head size (in elements)."
msgstr "``HS`` —— 注意力头大小（以元素为单位）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1064
msgid ""
"``dtype`` -- element dtype (e.g. ``float16``, ``bfloat16``, ``float32``, "
"``uint8``). The full set matches the keys of ``DTYPE_MAP`` in "
"``lmcache/v1/kv_layer_groups.py``."
msgstr ""
"``dtype`` —— 元素数据类型（例如 ``float16``\\ 、\\ ``bfloat16``\\ 、\\ ``float32``\\"
" 、\\ ``uint8``\\ ），完整集合与 ``lmcache/v1/kv_layer_groups.py`` 中 "
"``DTYPE_MAP`` 的键一致。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1067
msgid "``layers`` -- number of layers in this group."
msgstr "``layers`` —— 该组包含的层数。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1069
msgid ""
"Multi-group specs let you model heterogeneous layers (for example, MLA "
"layers + classical attention layers in the same model):"
msgstr "多组规格支持对异构层建模（例如，同一模型中同时包含 MLA 层和经典注意力层）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1078
msgid ""
"All groups must share the same ``NB`` and ``BS`` (this is a physical "
"constraint of paged KV). Layer counts across groups sum to the total "
"layer count registered with the server."
msgstr "所有组必须共享相同的 ``NB`` 和 ``BS``\\ （这是分页 KV 的物理约束），各组层数之和等于向服务器注册的总层数。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1083
msgid "MLA (Multi-head Latent Attention)"
msgstr "MLA（多头潜在注意力）"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1085
msgid ""
"Set ``kv_size=1`` to exercise the MLA data path. MLA folds K and V into a"
" single latent plane, so each chunk on the wire is ``(num_layers, "
"chunk_tokens, num_heads * head_size)`` instead of the classical ``(2, "
"num_layers, chunk_tokens, num_heads * head_size)``. The bench also "
"allocates each per-layer client tensor as rank-3 ``(NB, BS, num_heads * "
"head_size)`` (rather than the classical rank-5 ``(2, NB, BS, NH, HS)``), "
"which is what the server's vLLM detector recognises as MLA -- see "
"``NL_X_NB_BS_HS`` in "
"``lmcache/v1/gpu_connector/kv_format/detectors/vllm.py``."
msgstr "将 ``kv_size=1`` 设置为激活 MLA 数据路径。MLA 将 K 和 V 合并为一个单一的潜在平面，因此每个传输中的块为 ``(num_layers, chunk_tokens, num_heads * head_size)``，而不是经典的 ``(2, num_layers, chunk_tokens, num_heads * head_size)``。基准还将每个逐层客户端张量分配为三维 ``(NB, BS, num_heads * head_size)``（而不是经典的五维 ``(2, NB, BS, NH, HS)``），这就是服务器的 vLLM 检测器识别为 MLA 的格式 -- 参见 ``NL_X_NB_BS_HS`` 在 ``lmcache/v1/gpu_connector/kv_format/detectors/vllm.py`` 中。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1095
msgid "Pure MLA example (DeepSeek-V2-style, 61 layers, single latent head):"
msgstr "纯粹的 MLA 示例（DeepSeek-V2 风格，61 层，单一潜在头）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1103
msgid "Both transfer modes support MLA:"
msgstr "两种传输模式都支持 MLA："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1105
msgid ""
"``lmcache_driven`` (GPU default / CPU opt-in): the server discovers "
"``use_mla`` from the registered tensor shapes -- the bench's rank-3 MLA "
"client tensors trip this automatically."
msgstr "``lmcache_driven``（GPU 默认 / CPU 选择性使用）：服务器从注册的张量形状中发现 ``use_mla`` -- 基准的三维 MLA 客户端张量会自动触发这一点。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1108
msgid ""
"``engine_driven`` (CPU default): the bench derives ``use_mla`` from "
"``kv_size`` in the spec and sends it on the register payload, so the "
"server sizes its SHM chunks correctly."
msgstr "``engine_driven`` (CPU 默认): 基准从规范中的 ``kv_size`` 推导出 ``use_mla`` 并将其发送到注册负载，因此服务器可以正确地调整其 SHM 块的大小。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1114
msgid ""
"Heterogeneous specs that mix ``kv_size=1`` and ``kv_size=2`` groups are "
"fully supported in ``lmcache_driven`` mode -- each layer's rank (3 vs. 5)"
" tells the detector which per-group KV format to use. In "
"``engine_driven`` mode the server registers a *single* SHM chunk shape "
"per context, so a mixed spec falls back to the classical (non-MLA) "
"layout; use ``lmcache_driven`` when you need true per-group MLA."
msgstr "在 ``lmcache_driven`` 模式下，混合 ``kv_size=1`` 和 ``kv_size=2`` 组的异构规格是完全支持的——每层的排名（3 与 5）告诉检测器使用哪种每组 KV 格式。在 ``engine_driven`` 模式下，服务器为每个上下文注册一个 *单一* 的 SHM 块形状，因此混合规格会回退到经典（非 MLA）布局；当您需要真正的每组 MLA 时，请使用 ``lmcache_driven``。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1123
msgid "Tensor Parallel (TP > 1)"
msgstr "张量并行 (TP > 1)"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1125
msgid ""
"``--tp-size N`` (default: 1) simulates a TP world of ``N`` vLLM workers "
"against a single LMCache server. Each rank registers its own KV cache "
"under a distinct ``instance_id``, so the server holds one context per "
"rank -- exactly the layout ``LMCacheMPWorkerAdapter`` creates in a real "
"deployment. Fan-out for the store / retrieve / lookup ops mirrors "
"``ParallelStrategy`` from the vLLM adapter:"
msgstr "``--tp-size N``（默认值：1）模拟一个有 ``N`` 个 vLLM 工作者的 TP 世界，与单个 LMCache 服务器进行交互。每个 rank 在不同的 ``instance_id`` 下注册自己的 KV Cache，因此服务器为每个 rank 保留一个上下文——这正是 ``LMCacheMPWorkerAdapter`` 在实际部署中创建的布局。存储/检索/查找操作的分发方式与 vLLM 适配器中的 ``ParallelStrategy`` 相似："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1132
msgid ""
"``LOOKUP`` fires exactly once per request (scheduler-scoped, "
"``worker_id=None``)."
msgstr "``LOOKUP`` 每个请求只触发一次（调度器范围，``worker_id=None``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1134
msgid ""
"``RETRIEVE`` fires on **every** rank -- each worker loads its own KV "
"shard back."
msgstr "``RETRIEVE`` 在 **每个** 进程上触发 -- 每个工作者加载自己的 KV 分片。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1136
msgid ""
"``STORE`` fires on **KV writers only**. Non-MLA: every rank is a writer. "
"MLA: only rank 0 is a writer (the latent plane is shared across ranks; "
"storing from every rank would just re-write identical bytes)."
msgstr "``STORE`` 仅在 **KV 写入器** 上触发。非 MLA：每个 rank 都是写入器。MLA：只有 rank 0 是写入器（潜在平面在各个 rank 之间共享；从每个 rank 存储只会重写相同的字节）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1141
msgid "Example: MLA + TP=2, exercising rank 0 STORE + both-rank RETRIEVE:"
msgstr "示例：MLA + TP=2，执行 rank 0 STORE + 双 rank RETRIEVE："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1151
msgid ""
"The bench's client-side checksum aggregates writer-rank bytes only, so a "
"cold-vs-warm mismatch pinpoints the exact rank whose round trip went "
"wrong -- useful for verifying that a new server-side change handles per-"
"rank ``instance_id`` routing correctly."
msgstr "基准测试的客户端校验和仅聚合写入者排名的字节，因此冷与热的不匹配可以精确定位到出错的排名 -- 这对于验证新的服务器端更改是否正确处理每个排名的 ``instance_id`` 路由非常有用。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1156
msgid ""
"See ``parse_kvcache_shape_spec`` in ``lmcache/v1/kv_layer_groups.py`` for"
" the authoritative parsing rules and validation errors."
msgstr ""
"完整的解析规则和验证错误说明请参阅 ``lmcache/v1/kv_layer_groups.py`` 中的 "
"``parse_kvcache_shape_spec``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1161
msgid "Profiling the server"
msgstr "对服务器进行性能分析"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1163
msgid ""
"``lmcache bench server`` is a ZMQ client: the store path it exercises "
"(hashing, allocation, gather, D2H) runs inside the **server** process, "
"not this benchmark. ``--flamegraph on`` therefore attaches the profiler "
"to a server pid you supply, records for the duration of the load, and "
"renders a flame graph of the server, not of the client."
msgstr ""
"``lmcache bench server`` 是一个 ZMQ 客户端：它所使用的存储路径（哈希、分配、收集、D2H）在 **server** "
"进程内部运行，而不是在这个基准测试中。因此，``--flamegraph on`` 会将分析器附加到您提供的服务器进程 "
"ID，记录负载持续时间，并渲染服务器的火焰图，而不是客户端的火焰图。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1177
msgid ""
"``--flamegraph-mode`` takes the same six values documented under "
":ref:`lmcache tool flamegraph <lmcache-flamegraph-modes>` (or several "
"comma-separated to drive the load once per mode, one SVG each). Because "
"the target is a separate, already-running server (not a process this "
"benchmark spawns), it profiles by *attaching*, so the same attach-mode "
"caveats documented for :doc:`lmcache tool flamegraph </cli/tool>` apply "
"here: what each mode shows, the ``PYTHONPERFSUPPORT=1`` requirement for "
"naming Python frames in the perf/bcc modes, the container privileges each"
" mode needs, and the fact that recording a live process is never free."
msgstr ""
"``--flamegraph-mode`` 接受与 :ref:`lmcache tool flamegraph <lmcache-"
"flamegraph-modes>` 中文档记录的相同六个值（或多个以逗号分隔的值，以便每种模式各驱动一次负载，每种模式生成一个 "
"SVG）。因为目标是一个独立的、已经运行的服务器（而不是这个基准测试生成的进程），它通过 *附加* 进行分析，因此适用于 "
":doc:`lmcache tool flamegraph </cli/tool>` 中记录的相同附加模式警告：每种模式显示的内容、在 "
"perf/bcc 模式下命名 Python 框架所需的 ``PYTHONPERFSUPPORT=1`` "
"要求、每种模式所需的容器权限，以及记录实时进程从来不是免费的事实。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1190
msgid ""
"The one thing unique to ``bench server``: it records *while* it drives "
"load, so the recording overhead lands on the very throughput/latency this"
" benchmark reports. Keep the profiled run short and read those numbers as"
" indicative, not a clean baseline."
msgstr ""
"``bench server`` "
"唯一的特点是：它在施加负载的同时进行记录，因此记录的开销会影响该基准测试报告的吞吐量/延迟。请保持被分析的运行时间短，并将这些数字视为指示性，而不是一个干净的基准线。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1199
msgid ""
"After the run completes (or is interrupted with ``Ctrl-C``), a structured"
" metrics summary is printed. The summary includes:"
msgstr "运行完成后（或被 ``Ctrl-C`` 中断后），将打印结构化的指标摘要，内容包括："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1202
msgid ""
"**Configuration** -- RPC URL, mode, transfer mode, tokens per request, "
"interval."
msgstr "**配置** —— RPC URL、模式、传输模式、每请求 token 数、间隔。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1204
msgid "**Results** -- total requests, checksum OK / FAIL counts, pass rate."
msgstr "**结果** —— 总请求数、校验和 OK／FAIL 计数、通过率。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1205
msgid ""
"**Latency sections** -- per-operation latency statistics (count, mean, "
"min, max, p50, p99) for cold lookup, cold store, warm lookup, and warm "
"retrieve."
msgstr "**延迟部分** —— 每个操作的延迟统计信息（count、mean、min、max、p50、p99），涵盖冷查找、冷存储、热查找和热检索。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1209
msgid ""
"Use ``--format json`` to get machine-readable output, or ``--output "
"FILE`` to save the summary to a file."
msgstr "使用 ``--format json`` 获取机器可读的输出，或使用 ``--output FILE`` 将摘要保存到文件中。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1258
msgid "Example output (progress)"
msgstr "示例输出（进度）"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1260
msgid ""
"During the run, progress messages are printed to stdout (suppressed by "
"``-q`` / ``--quiet``):"
msgstr "运行期间，进度消息会打印到 stdout（可通过 ``-q`` / ``--quiet`` 禁止）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1275
msgid ""
"Any ``CHECKSUM MISMATCH``, ``ERROR``, or Python traceback in the log "
"indicates a real problem worth investigating."
msgstr "日志中出现任何 ``CHECKSUM MISMATCH``\\ 、\\ ``ERROR`` 或 Python 回溯，均表明存在值得调查的真实问题。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1280 ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1704
msgid "Exit codes"
msgstr "退出代码"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1289
msgid ""
"Test loop completed (or was interrupted cleanly with Ctrl-C) with no "
"checksum mismatches."
msgstr "测试循环正常完成（或通过 Ctrl-C 干净中断），无校验和不匹配。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1292
msgid ""
"Fatal error (for example, CUDA unavailable in ``--mode gpu``, server "
"unreachable, or a checksum mismatch)."
msgstr "致命错误（例如，\\ ``--mode gpu`` 时 CUDA 不可用、服务器无法访问或校验和不匹配）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1298
msgid "l2"
msgstr "l2"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1300
msgid ""
"The ``lmcache bench l2`` command benchmarks an L2 cache adapter (e.g. the"
" local-filesystem adapter) end-to-end through the same "
"``parse_args_to_l2_adapters_config`` + ``create_l2_adapter`` pipeline "
"that LMCache uses in production. Any registered adapter type can be "
"tested without code changes: you describe the adapter with a single JSON "
"spec and pick the operations to exercise."
msgstr ""
"``lmcache bench l2`` 命令通过与 LMCache 生产环境相同的 "
"``parse_args_to_l2_adapters_config`` + ``create_l2_adapter`` 流水线，对 L2 "
"缓存适配器（例如本地文件系统适配器）进行端到端基准测试。任何已注册的适配器类型均可在无需修改代码的情况下进行测试：只需用一个 JSON "
"规范描述该适配器，并选择要执行的操作即可。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1311
msgid ""
"Unlike :ref:`lmcache bench engine <lmcache-bench-engine>`, this command "
"does **not** require an inference engine or an LMCache MP server. It only"
" needs the adapter's own backing storage to be reachable (for the ``fs`` "
"adapter, that simply means a writable directory)."
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`lmcache bench engine <lmcache-bench-engine>` 不同，此命令 **不** 需要推理引擎或"
" LMCache MP 服务器，只需适配器的后端存储可访问（对于 ``fs`` 适配器，只需一个可写目录）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1320
msgid ""
"For each measured operation the tool drives the adapter directly via its "
"public submit/wait API:"
msgstr "对于每个待测操作，该工具通过适配器的公共 submit/wait API 直接驱动适配器："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1323
msgid ""
"``Store``  -- ``submit_store_task`` writes ``num_keys`` MemoryObjs per "
"submit and waits for the store eventfd."
msgstr ""
"``Store``  -- ``submit_store_task`` 每次提交写入 ``num_keys`` 个 MemoryObj，并等待存储"
" eventfd。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1325
msgid ""
"``Lookup`` -- ``submit_lookup_and_lock_task`` checks key existence (no "
"payload transfer) and waits for the lookup eventfd."
msgstr ""
"``Lookup`` -- ``submit_lookup_and_lock_task`` 检查键是否存在（不传输负载），并等待查找 "
"eventfd。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1327
msgid ""
"``Load``   -- ``submit_load_task`` reads ``num_keys`` MemoryObjs per "
"submit and waits for the load eventfd."
msgstr ""
"``Load``   -- ``submit_load_task`` 每次提交读取 ``num_keys`` 个 MemoryObj，并等待加载 "
"eventfd。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1330
msgid ""
"Each measured **round** issues ``--in-flight`` submits sequentially from "
"a single producer thread and then waits for all of them to complete; the "
"round duration is the wall-clock time from the first submit until the "
"last completion. Warmup rounds run before measurement and their results "
"are discarded from the final summary."
msgstr ""
"每个测量 **轮次** 从单个生产者线程顺序发出 ``--in-flight`` "
"次提交，然后等待全部完成；轮次持续时间为从第一次提交到最后一次完成的墙钟时间。预热轮次在测量前运行，其结果不计入最终摘要。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1336
msgid ""
"All three operations share the same key idx universe, so running ``--only"
" store`` followed by ``--only load`` (or ``--only lookup``) with "
"identical other flags hits exactly the same keys. This makes the "
"benchmark useful as a quick regression test for adapters that should "
"support a clean store -> load round-trip."
msgstr ""
"三种操作共享相同的键索引空间，因此在其他参数不变的情况下先运行 ``--only store`` 再运行 ``--only load``\\ （或"
" ``--only lookup``\\ ）会访问完全相同的键。这使基准测试可作为适配器的快速回归测试，验证其是否支持完整的存储 -> 加载往返。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1344
msgid ""
"When ``--only`` is not given, the three operations are run **in a single "
"process in the order** ``store -> lookup -> load``. For adapters whose "
"backing storage sits behind an OS-level cache -- most notably the local-"
"filesystem (``fs``) adapter, which is subject to the Linux **page cache**"
" -- this means ``lookup`` and ``load`` will almost always observe the "
"data that ``store`` just wrote still hot in RAM, and the reported numbers"
" reflect page-cache throughput rather than the underlying device."
msgstr ""
"若未指定 ``--only``\\ ，三个操作将在 **单个进程中按顺序** 执行：\\ ``store -> lookup -> "
"load``\\ 。对于后端存储位于操作系统级缓存之后的适配器——尤其是受 Linux **页面缓存** 影响的本地文件系统（\\ "
"``fs``\\ ）适配器——``lookup`` 和 ``load`` 几乎总能观察到 ``store`` 刚写入的数据仍驻留在 RAM "
"中，因此上报数字反映的是页面缓存吞吐量而非底层设备吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1353
msgid ""
"To benchmark each operation against a cold cache, run them separately "
"with ``--only`` and drop the OS caches in between, for example::"
msgstr "若要在冷缓存条件下对各操作分别进行基准测试，请使用 ``--only`` 单独运行，并在两次运行之间清除操作系统缓存，例如::"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1363
msgid ""
"For adapters that bypass the page cache (e.g. ``fs`` with "
"``\"use_odirect\": true``) or that talk to a remote service without a "
"local cache, the default combined run is usually fine."
msgstr ""
"对于绕过页面缓存的适配器（例如设置了 ``\"use_odirect\": true`` 的 ``fs`` "
"适配器）或与无本地缓存的远程服务通信的适配器，直接使用默认的组合运行即可。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1367
msgid ""
"O_DIRECT adapters may also require the benchmark L1 buffer to satisfy the"
" adapter's block alignment. Use ``--l1-align-bytes`` to set that "
"alignment, commonly ``4096`` for local block devices. The payload size "
"(``--data-size-kb * 1024``) must be a multiple of the selected alignment."
msgstr ""
"O_DIRECT 适配器可能还要求基准测试的 L1 缓冲区满足适配器的块对齐要求。可通过 ``--l1-align-bytes`` "
"设置对齐值，本地块设备通常为 ``4096``\\ 。负载大小（\\ ``--data-size-kb * 1024``\\ "
"）必须是该对齐值的整数倍。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1377
msgid "Benchmark the local filesystem adapter with default parameters:"
msgstr "使用默认参数对本地文件系统适配器进行基准测试："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1384
msgid ""
"This runs all three operations (store, lookup, load) with one warmup "
"round and one measurement round."
msgstr "将运行全部三个操作（store、lookup、load），包括一次预热轮次和一次测量轮次。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1387
msgid "Stress the adapter with more in-flight submits and larger payloads:"
msgstr "使用更多并发提交和更大负载对适配器施压："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1397
msgid "Benchmark an O_DIRECT adapter with aligned L1 buffers:"
msgstr "对使用对齐 L1 缓冲区的 O_DIRECT 适配器进行基准测试："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1406
msgid "Run only one operation (useful to isolate store vs. load throughput):"
msgstr "仅运行单个操作（用于单独测量 store 与 load 的吞吐量）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1414
msgid ""
"Lookup with a controlled hit rate (the benchmark splits the lookup keys "
"between a potentially-existing range and a guaranteed-non-existent "
"range):"
msgstr "使用受控命中率执行查找（基准测试将查找键拆分为可能存在的范围和保证不存在的范围）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1424
msgid ""
"Enable a store -> load round-trip data integrity check on the last "
"measured round:"
msgstr "在最后一轮测量中启用 store -> load 往返数据完整性校验："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1433
msgid ""
"If you prefer to keep the JSON spec out of the command line, set the "
"``L2_ADAPTER_JSON`` environment variable instead of passing "
"``--l2-adapter``:"
msgstr ""
"如果希望不在命令行中暴露 JSON 规范，可设置 ``L2_ADAPTER_JSON`` 环境变量，而无需传递 "
"``--l2-adapter``\\ ："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1453
msgid "``--l2-adapter JSON``"
msgstr "``--l2-adapter JSON``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1455
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"L2 adapter spec as JSON with a ``\"type\"`` field plus adapter-specific "
"configs, e.g. ``'{\"type\":\"fs\",\"base_path\":\"/tmp/bench\"}'``. May "
"be passed multiple times; only the first spec is benchmarked. If not "
"provided, falls back to the ``L2_ADAPTER_JSON`` environment variable. "
"Either the flag or the env var is **required**."
msgstr ""
"L2 适配器规范，以 JSON 格式提供，包含 ``\"type\"`` 字段及适配器专项配置，例如 "
"``'{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fs\\\",\\\"base_path\\\":\\\"/tmp/bench\\\"}'``\\ "
"。可多次传递；仅对第一个规范进行基准测试。若未提供，则退回到 ``L2_ADAPTER_JSON`` 环境变量。该参数或环境变量二者之一 "
"**必须** 指定。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1461
msgid "``--num-keys N``"
msgstr "``--num-keys N``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1462
msgid "``32``"
msgstr "``32``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1463
msgid "Number of keys per submit."
msgstr "每次提交的键数。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1464
msgid "``--in-flight N``"
msgstr "``--in-flight N``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1466
msgid ""
"In-flight submits per round. Each round issues this many submits "
"sequentially from a single producer thread, then waits for all of them."
msgstr "每轮的在途提交数。每轮从单个生产者线程按序发出指定数量的提交，然后等待全部完成。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1469
msgid "``--data-size-kb N``"
msgstr "``--data-size-kb N``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1470
msgid "``256``"
msgstr "``256``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1471
msgid "Data size per key, in KiB."
msgstr "每个键的数据大小，单位为 KiB。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1472
msgid "``--l1-align-bytes N``"
msgstr "``--l1-align-bytes N``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1474
msgid ""
"Alignment in bytes for benchmark L1 buffers. Use a value at least as "
"large as the adapter's block alignment when benchmarking O_DIRECT "
"backends, for example ``4096`` for local block devices. ``--data-size-kb "
"* 1024`` must be a multiple of this value."
msgstr ""
"基准测试 L1 缓冲区的对齐字节数。测试 O_DIRECT 后端时，该值应不小于适配器的块对齐要求，本地块设备通常为 ``4096``\\ 。\\"
" ``--data-size-kb * 1024`` 必须是该值的整数倍。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1479
msgid "``--rounds N``"
msgstr "``--rounds N``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1481
msgid "Measurement rounds per operation."
msgstr "每个操作的测量轮数。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1482
msgid "``--warmup-rounds N``"
msgstr "``--warmup-rounds N``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1484
msgid "Warmup rounds run before measurement; their results are discarded."
msgstr "在测量前运行的预热轮次，其结果不计入统计。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1486
msgid "``--lookup-max-hit-rate F``"
msgstr "``--lookup-max-hit-rate F``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1487
msgid "``0.0``"
msgstr "``0.0``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1488
msgid ""
"Upper bound on the lookup hit rate, in ``[0, 1]``. The benchmark requests"
" ``floor(N * rate)`` keys from the potentially-existing range and ``N - "
"hit`` keys from a guaranteed-non-existent range, where ``N`` is the total"
" number of lookup keys. The actual hit rate may be lower if those keys "
"were never stored in this run."
msgstr ""
"查找命中率的上限，范围为 ``[0, 1]``\\ 。基准测试请求 ``floor(N * rate)`` 个来自可能存在范围的键，以及 ``N "
"- hit`` 个来自保证不存在范围的键，其中 ``N`` 为查找键总数。若这些键在本次运行中从未被存储过，则实际命中率可能更低。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1494
msgid "``--skip-verify`` / ``--no-skip-verify``"
msgstr "``--skip-verify`` / ``--no-skip-verify``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1495
msgid "``--skip-verify``"
msgstr "``--skip-verify``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1496
msgid ""
"Skip the store -> load round-trip data integrity check (the default). "
"Pass ``--no-skip-verify`` to enable verification on the last measured "
"round; this requires both ``store`` and ``load`` to be exercised."
msgstr ""
"跳过 store -> load 往返数据完整性检查（默认行为）。传递 ``--no-skip-verify`` "
"可在最后一轮测量中启用校验，此时要求同时执行 ``store`` 和 ``load``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1500
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``--only {lookup,store,load}``"
msgstr "``--only {lookup,store,load}``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1502
msgid ""
"Run only the specified operation. When omitted, all three operations are "
"run in the order ``store -> lookup -> load``."
msgstr "仅运行指定操作。省略时，按 ``store -> lookup -> load`` 顺序运行全部三个操作。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1504
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``--flamegraph {on,off}``"
msgstr "``--flamegraph {开,关}``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1505
msgid "``off``"
msgstr "``关``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1506
msgid ""
"Capture a flame graph of the measured phases (``on``) or run the "
"benchmark normally (``off``). When ``on``, the benchmark profiles itself "
"and renders an SVG. Default ``off`` leaves benchmark behavior unchanged. "
"See :ref:`Profiling / flame charts <lmcache-bench-l2-profiling>`."
msgstr ""
"捕获测量阶段的火焰图（``on``）或正常运行基准测试（``off``）。当设置为``on``时，基准测试会对自身进行分析并渲染 "
"SVG。默认的``off``不会改变基准测试的行为。请参见 :ref:`Profiling / flame charts <lmcache-"
"bench-l2-profiling>`。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1511
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``--flamegraph-mode {on-cpu,off-cpu,wakeup,offwake,wall,gil}``"
msgstr "``--flamegraph-mode {on-cpu,off-cpu,wakeup,offwake,wall,gil}``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1512
msgid "``on-cpu``"
msgstr "``on-cpu``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1513
msgid ""
"Flame-graph mode for ``--flamegraph on``. ``on-cpu`` shows where CPU time"
" goes; ``off-cpu`` shows time blocked on I/O / locks (best for I/O-bound "
"adapters); ``offwake`` adds the waker stack to each blocked stack; "
"``wakeup`` shows the stacks doing the waking. ``wall`` and ``gil`` (``py-"
"spy``) split the chart per thread: wall-clock time, and time holding the "
"interpreter lock."
msgstr ""
"``--flamegraph on`` 的火焰图模式。 ``on-cpu`` 显示 CPU 时间的去向； ``off-cpu`` 显示在 I/O "
"/ 锁上阻塞的时间（最适合 I/O 绑定的适配器）； ``offwake`` 将唤醒者栈添加到每个阻塞栈； ``wakeup`` "
"显示进行唤醒的栈。 ``wall`` 和 ``gil`` （``py-spy``）按线程拆分图表：墙钟时间和持有解释器锁的时间。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1520
msgid "``--flamegraph-output PATH``"
msgstr "``--flamegraph-output PATH``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1521
msgid "*(auto)*"
msgstr "*(自动)*"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1522
msgid ""
"SVG output path. Default: "
"``/tmp/lmcache_bench_flames/<adapter>.<mode>.svg``."
msgstr "SVG 输出路径。默认: ``/tmp/lmcache_bench_flames/<adapter>.<mode>.svg``。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1524
msgid "``--flamegraph-scripts-dir DIR``"
msgstr "``--flamegraph-scripts-dir DIR``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1525
msgid "*(~/FlameGraph)*"
msgstr "*(~/FlameGraph)*"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1526
msgid ""
"Directory with the FlameGraph scripts (``flamegraph.pl``, "
"``stackcollapse-perf.pl``)."
msgstr "包含 FlameGraph 脚本的目录（``flamegraph.pl``，``stackcollapse-perf.pl``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1531
msgid "Adapter JSON spec"
msgstr "适配器 JSON 规范"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1533
msgid ""
"The ``--l2-adapter`` JSON is parsed by "
"``lmcache.v1.distributed.l2_adapters.config.parse_args_to_l2_adapters_config``,"
" the same entry point LMCache uses everywhere else. The minimum required "
"field is ``type``; all remaining fields are forwarded to the adapter "
"implementation as keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
"``--l2-adapter`` JSON 由 "
"``lmcache.v1.distributed.l2_adapters.config.parse_args_to_l2_adapters_config``"
" 解析，这也是 LMCache 在其他地方使用的同一入口点。最小必填字段为 ``type``\\ ，其余字段均以关键字参数形式转发给适配器实现。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1539
msgid "Example for the local-filesystem adapter:"
msgstr "本地文件系统适配器示例："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1551
msgid ""
"See the source under ``lmcache/v1/distributed/l2_adapters/`` for the full"
" list of adapter types and their accepted fields."
msgstr "适配器类型及其支持字段的完整列表，请参阅 ``lmcache/v1/distributed/l2_adapters/`` 目录下的源代码。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1556
msgid "Example output"
msgstr "示例输出"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1558
msgid "Per-round progress (suppressed by ``-q``):"
msgstr "每轮进度（可通过 ``-q`` 禁止）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1591
msgid "Final summary (one section per exercised operation):"
msgstr "最终摘要（每个操作对应一个部分）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1622
msgid ""
"Each operation section reports per-round duration statistics (avg / min /"
" max / p50 / p99 / std), aggregate throughput (``avg_throughput_mbps`` --"
" 0 for ``Lookup`` since it has no payload), average key-rate "
"(``avg_ops_per_sec``), and a per-key latency."
msgstr ""
"每个操作部分报告每轮持续时间统计（avg / min / max / p50 / p99 / std）、汇总吞吐量（\\ "
"``avg_throughput_mbps``\\ ，\\ ``Lookup`` 为 0，因其无负载传输）、平均键速率（\\ "
"``avg_ops_per_sec``\\ ）及每键延迟。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1627
msgid ""
"``Rounds`` counts every round that was issued, and ``Rounds timed out`` "
"counts the subset that hit the wait timeout. A round that times out has "
"no meaningful duration, so it is excluded from all duration and "
"throughput statistics; the keys it issued still count toward ``Total "
"keys``, and the keys that did succeed before the timeout still count "
"toward ``Total success``. When ``Rounds timed out`` is non-zero, read the"
" duration and throughput figures as describing the rounds that completed."
msgstr "``Rounds`` 统计每个发出的轮次，而 ``Rounds timed out`` 统计达到等待超时的子集。超时的轮次没有有意义的持续时间，因此被排除在所有持续时间和吞吐量统计之外；它发出的键仍然计入 ``Total keys``，而在超时之前成功的键仍然计入 ``Total success``。当 ``Rounds timed out`` 非零时，请将持续时间和吞吐量数据视为描述已完成的轮次。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1636
msgid ""
"For ``Lookup``, three additional fields are reported when ``--lookup-max-"
"hit-rate`` is non-zero or some keys were found:"
msgstr "对于 ``Lookup``\\ ，当 ``--lookup-max-hit-rate`` 非零或存在命中键时，还会上报以下三个额外字段："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1639
msgid "``Expected max hit rate`` -- the configured upper bound."
msgstr "``Expected max hit rate`` —— 已配置的命中率上限。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1640
msgid ""
"``Expected hit keys`` -- ``floor(total_keys * rate)``, scaled for the "
"measured rounds only."
msgstr "``Expected hit keys`` —— ``floor(total_keys * rate)``\\ ，仅对测量轮次进行缩放。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1642
msgid "``Actual hit rate`` -- the measured hit rate over the kept rounds."
msgstr "``Actual hit rate`` —— 在有效测量轮次中实测的命中率。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1646
msgid "Round-trip verification"
msgstr "往返验证"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1648
msgid ""
"When ``--no-skip-verify`` is passed and both ``store`` and ``load`` were "
"run, the benchmark compares the load buffers from the last measured round"
" against the byte pattern that ``store`` wrote (see "
"``make_memory_objects`` in "
"``lmcache/cli/commands/bench/l2_adapter_bench/data.py``):"
msgstr ""
"当传递 ``--no-skip-verify`` 且同时运行了 ``store`` 和 ``load`` "
"时，基准测试会将最后一轮测量的加载缓冲区与 ``store`` 写入的字节模式进行比对（参见 "
"``lmcache/cli/commands/bench/l2_adapter_bench/data.py`` 中的 "
"``make_memory_objects``\\ ）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1659
msgid ""
"Verification is **off** by default because the stricter byte pattern "
"requires both the store and load object batches to stay resident so the "
"loaded data can be compared against the original store pattern."
msgstr "默认情况下，验证是 **关闭** 的，因为更严格的字节模式要求存储和加载对象批次均保持常驻内存，以便将加载的数据与原始存储模式进行比对。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1667
msgid "Profiling / flame charts"
msgstr "性能分析 / 火焰图"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1669
msgid ""
"When ``--flamegraph on`` is passed, the benchmark profiles **its own "
"process** (the L2 adapter driven by this microbenchmark's synthetic load)"
" and renders a flame graph of the measured phases (to profile a separate "
"server or a real process instead, use :doc:`lmcache tool flamegraph "
"</cli/tool>`):"
msgstr ""
"当传递 ``--flamegraph on`` 时，基准测试会对 **其自身进程**（由该微基准测试的合成负载驱动的 L2 "
"适配器）进行性能分析，并渲染测量阶段的火焰图（要分析单独的服务器或真实进程，请使用 :doc:`lmcache tool flamegraph "
"</cli/tool>`）："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1683
msgid ""
"The ``--flamegraph-mode`` values, cost of recording, and tool / sysctl "
"requirements are documented under :ref:`lmcache tool flamegraph <lmcache-"
"flamegraph-modes>` (or pass several comma-separated to profile one "
"benchmark run per mode, one SVG each). What is specific to ``bench l2``:"
msgstr ""
"``--flamegraph-mode`` 的值、记录成本以及工具 / sysctl 要求在 :ref:`lmcache tool "
"flamegraph <lmcache-flamegraph-modes>` "
"中有文档说明（或者传递多个用逗号分隔的值以便为每种模式配置一个基准测试运行，每种模式生成一个 SVG）。与 ``bench l2`` "
"相关的特定内容："

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1689
msgid ""
"It **self-profiles**, so on CPython 3.12+ it activates the perf "
"trampolines itself and adapter functions resolve as ``py::<qualname>`` in"
" the ``on-cpu`` / ``off-cpu`` charts with no ``PYTHONPERFSUPPORT`` needed"
" (an attached server cannot). Trampolines cost a few percent, so treat a "
"profiled run's timings as indicative."
msgstr ""
"它**自我分析**，因此在 CPython 3.12+ 上，它会自动激活性能跳板，并且适配器函数在 ``on-cpu`` / ``off-"
"cpu`` 图表中解析为 ``py::<qualname>``，无需 "
"``PYTHONPERFSUPPORT``（附加的服务器无法做到这一点）。跳板会消耗几个百分点的性能，因此将分析运行的时间视为指示性。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1694
msgid ""
"The recorder runs as a child of the benchmark, so ``wall`` / ``gil`` need"
" ``kernel.yama.ptrace_scope`` at ``0`` (not the attach-mode permissions)."
msgstr ""
"记录器作为基准的子进程运行，因此 ``wall`` / ``gil`` 需要将 ``kernel.yama.ptrace_scope`` 设置为 "
"``0``（而不是附加模式权限）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1696
msgid ""
"Recording covers only the measured work, so use a large ``--rounds``; too"
" short a run captures no samples."
msgstr "录制仅涵盖测量的工作，因此请使用较大的 ``--rounds``；运行时间过短将无法捕获样本。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1699
msgid ""
"The SVG is written to ``--flamegraph-output`` (default "
"``/tmp/lmcache_bench_flames/<adapter>.<mode>.svg``)."
msgstr ""
"SVG 文件写入 ``--flamegraph-output``（默认 "
"``/tmp/lmcache_bench_flames/<adapter>.<mode>.svg``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1713
msgid ""
"All requested operations completed and (when enabled) the round-trip "
"verification passed."
msgstr "所有请求操作均已完成，且（在启用时）往返验证通过。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1716
msgid ""
"Adapter creation failed, round-trip verification failed, or an operation "
"hit a fatal error (e.g. all rounds timed out)."
msgstr "适配器创建失败、往返验证失败，或某个操作遭遇致命错误（例如所有轮次均超时）。"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1718
msgid "``2``"
msgstr "``2``"

#: ../../source/cli/bench.rst:1719
msgid ""
"Invalid invocation: the ``--l2-adapter`` JSON / ``L2_ADAPTER_JSON`` env "
"var was missing or could not be parsed, an option value was invalid, or "
"``--flamegraph on`` was requested but the profiling toolchain is "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""
"无效的调用：缺少或无法解析 ``--l2-adapter`` JSON / ``L2_ADAPTER_JSON`` "
"环境变量，某个选项值无效，或者请求了 ``--flamegraph on`` 但分析工具链不可用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run mode. Only ``gpu`` is supported "
#~ "today; CPU mode is a planned "
#~ "follow-up."
#~ msgstr "运行模式。目前仅支持 ``gpu``；CPU 模式是计划中的后续功能。"

