#~ msgid ""
#~ "When ``--flamegraph on`` is passed, the"
#~ " benchmark profiles the L2 adapter's "
#~ "performance and renders a flame graph"
#~ " of the measured phases:"
#~ msgstr "当传递 ``--flamegraph on`` 时，基准测试会对 L2 适配器的性能进行分析，并渲染出测量阶段的火焰图："

#~ msgid ""
