#~ "off`` skips all of this and leaves"
#~ " benchmark behavior unchanged."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**要求。** 渲染需要 Brendan Gregg 的 `FlameGraph"
#~ " <https://github.com/brendangregg/FlameGraph>`__ 脚本"
